    "path": "/itemdesc-spear-generic-hacking-*",
    "value": "Attack a locust for a chance to convert it into an ally. It will follow and protect you, but you can only maintain one converted locust at a time.\n\n<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>Bring the wayward children home.</i></font><br>",
